{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/b5d1284e289c8a1f63d1.json":{"assets":{"ep1/quest_story_11209010":{"skip":{"source_cn":"旅商塞拉菲娜在确定流沙之爪的人离开后，准备去找失散的商队成员。她就是旅商乔瓦尼走失的同伴。","text_i18n":{"cn":"旅商塞拉菲娜在确定流沙之爪的人离开后，准备去找失散的商队成员。她就是旅商乔瓦尼走失的同伴。","en":"After the Quicksand Claw has left, Serafina gets ready to find the lost caravan members. Incidentally, she is Johnny's companion who went missing.","jp":"旅商人セラフィーナはサンドクローが行ってしまったことを確認すると、散り散りになった商隊の仲間を探しにいくことにした。彼女は旅商人ジョワンニのはぐれた仲間だったのだ。","kr":"사막의 발톱이 떠난 걸 확인한 유랑 상인 세라피나가 잃어버린 상단 멤버를 찾아 떠나려고 한다. 그녀가 바로 유랑 상인 조반니의 잃어버린 파트너였다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["11209010"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["23074"]}}}},"locales/cn/ep1/quest_story/11209010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11209010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11209010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1120901001:0":{"text":"呼……现在是不是安全了？","source_cn":"呼……现在是不是安全了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x852228060921401B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120901002:0":{"text":"那些骑陆行鸟劫掠的混蛋……行进之风商队的同伴都被他们冲散了！幸好我找了个地方躲起来。","source_cn":"那些骑陆行鸟劫掠的混蛋……行进之风商队的同伴都被他们冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8E82D5783B8B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120901003:0":{"text":"你要是在周围看到散落的火药，就拿去用吧。都是被抢剩下的，也卖不出钱了……","source_cn":"你要是在周围看到散落的火药，就拿去用吧。都是被抢剩下的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AC419086C80C0EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen